<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">What is Generative Engine Optimization (GEO) and how is it different from SEO?</h3>
<p class="text-white/70">GEO optimizes content for AI-powered engines like ChatGPT and Claude, focusing on creating citable, structured content that AI can understand and recommend. Unlike traditional SEO which targets search engine rankings, GEO ensures your business appears in AI-generated responses and recommendations.</p>
